      "name": "Ade Suhada",
      "created_at": "2021-12-13T14:18:34.158Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi everyone, I wonder to fetch list of doctype including their childtable using REST API, is that possible ?<br>\nI found core frappe function to retrieves doctype list with childtable, but cors-origin occurs, the method is <code>api/method/frappe.desk.reportview.get?doctype=...</code>but working properly with postman.</p>\n<p>Thanks in advance for each suggestions,<br>\ncc: <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/rmeyer\">@rmeyer</a></p>",
