      "id": 308292,
      "username": "Okechukwu_Eze",
      "name": "Okechukwu Eze",
      "created_at": "2021-12-14T15:20:28.890Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I tried implementing your code on my end but its output is quite different from what i was expecting.</p>\n<p>The present output forces a duplicate record with the childtable field specified in each of the duplicate as seen in the picture bellow.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/7/a740f766a364ed570108959332ed1bdb397d4b57.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/a740f766a364ed570108959332ed1bdb397d4b57\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/7/a740f766a364ed570108959332ed1bdb397d4b57_2_576x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"nRAVv8MWRiD7fpZtanJSuXtww7R\" width=\"576\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/7/a740f766a364ed570108959332ed1bdb397d4b57_2_576x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/7/a740f766a364ed570108959332ed1bdb397d4b57_2_864x750.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/7/a740f766a364ed570108959332ed1bdb397d4b57.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAF9F9\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1006×872 55.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>What i was expecting is the value of the childTable to be added to each record as an array.</p><aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://prnt.sc/22z0cnw\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://prntscr.com/favicon.ico\" class=\"site-icon\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://prnt.sc/22z0cnw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Lightshot</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:562/500;\"><img src=\"https://image.prntscr.com/image/MFtjV5yrQYeW6l_nfnsFiw.png\" class=\"thumbnail\" width=\"562\" height=\"500\"></div>\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://prnt.sc/22z0cnw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Screenshot</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Captured with Lightshot</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>The way i do it now is to</p>\n<ul>\n<li>First Load all records using get_list from one end point</li>\n<li>Then hit another endpoint with the needed docname to get the childTable record</li>\n</ul>\n<p>So i am looking for how i would get this two records in one Endpoint JSON output</p>\n<p>I humbly await your response.</p>",
